Z||000000||Kwez||08-11-2001||02:24 PM||||it was too nice to be true.<P>it came back ! <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/012385.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/012385.html</A> <P>It seems to be on the same side (right rear).<BR>it doesn't happen as often<P>it feels / sounds like the caliper bites then lets go, bites, lets go ...<BR>tock tock tock tock tock<BR>(brand new rotors & pads)<P>so what now ?<BR>new calipers for the rear also ?<P>anyone ever had a prob like that ?<BR>ideas / suggestions ?<P>i don't want to pay for calipers & labour just to find out that the prob is not w. the calipers !<P>thanx<p>[This message has been edited by Kwez (edited 08-11-2001).]||||reg||8
